  m_Name: LS_026_KEEP_MOMENTUM
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedStringSO
  en: 'Oh! I almost forgot. Keep the momentum-going! Every fast-delivery builds your
    Combo-Multiplier--the faster you serve, the more points you stack. But be-careful:
    if a timer-expires or a customer-walks, your combo resets-to-zero! </color><color=#FF9E3A>
    Pro-tip: the Final-Payment is where the real coins-are. Get that card-reader
    to the table FAST for a massive-bonus! </color>

'
